    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d476-a2">

                <pb facs="0608" n="528" xml:id="pg528"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leishman to Mr.
                            Cole.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-03"><hi rendition="#italic">September 3,
                        1901</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>As the several officers of the Ottoman Government have failed to carry out their
                    promises, you are authorized by the legation to travel wherever your duty or
                    personal interests may call you on your American passport, taking always care to
                    inform [local governor?] of your movements. I am notifying Porte that I have
                    given you such instructions, and I will hold His Imperial Majesty’s Government
                    strictly accountable for any delay, damages, or injury that you may suffer.
                    Await receipt of letter which I am sending you giving full instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Leishman</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Minister.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
